; A table that actually declares a $Default Lens:, which the shipped
; lens_flares.tbl deliberately does not.
;
; Without a declared default, "take the tabled default" and "no flares at all"
; both come out as "no lens mounted", so the two cannot be told apart. That is
; exactly the case where a mission's explicit <none> used to be lost: it was
; stored as an empty string, an empty string was not written out, and on reload an
; absent $Camera Lens: became the default. This table is what lets a test see the
; difference.

#Lens Systems

$Default Lens: default_test_lens

$Name: default_test_lens
$Entrance Pupil Radius: 12.0
$Aperture Radius: 6.0
$Sensor Width: 36.0
$Lens Stack Start:
$Surface: ( 50.0, 4.0, 1.62 )
$Stop: ( 3.0 )
$Surface: ( -50.0, 40.0, 1.0 )
$Lens Stack End

#End
